      <description><![CDATA[<p>Netwright Studio 0.9.5 for Windows</p>
<ul>
<li>Settings no longer jumps to the top after Check for Updates, so the result stays in view.</li>
<li>Arabic and other non-Latin text (for example an Arabic Documents folder name) now displays correctly instead of as boxes.</li>
</ul>
<p>Your projects and settings are kept.</p>
]]></description>
